  "question": {
    "text": "An integer is chosen at random from the integers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>50</mn></math>. The probability that the chosen integer is a multiple of atleast one of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "omkOv",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></math>",
